    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d16">

                <pb facs="0094" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg14"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Von Callenberg, Chargé d’Affaires, to Mr.
                        Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Manchester, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am charged, on the occasion of the tragic death of President McKinley, to
                    convey to the Federal Government the warmest sympathy of His Imperial and Royal
                    Apostolic Majesty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Von Callenberg</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Austro-Hungarian Chargé
                    d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
